※ pl4g-test: module
※※ A function in another file, so that a call which leaves an argument out and
※※ one that names it are seen across a module boundary.
※
※ This is not a test of its own but a module the test beside it imports.  The
※ default is settled here, where the function is written; the caller never
※ sees what was written, only the value.
@[export]
fn twice(n: u8, by: u8 ← 10u8) → u8:
    n + by
